   "title": "The rules",
   "items": [
    "R1 edges meet, or on the table · R2 no overlap, nothing passes through",
    "R3 joined to the table · R4 steps in order, each next to what is built",
    "R5 one layer at a time · R6 everything stands after every step",
    "R7 whole pyramids, one step · R8 every brand's tall triangle · R9 fits the age"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Matching",
   "items": [
    "Counts by shape; colour is a preference",
    "Swaps in order: the project's own, low roofs, corner triangles, two squares for a rectangle, four for a big square",
